WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.358
Not sure where to start?

00:00:02.358 --> 00:00:03.987
That's okay.

00:00:03.987 --> 00:00:08.945
Sirr's designed for private sample collection at home, with a coded kit and

00:00:08.945 --> 00:00:10.751
clear instructions.

00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:14.428
A courier would take your sealed sample to the lab.

00:00:14.428 --> 00:00:18.763
You could follow each handoff, then open your report and talk it through

00:00:18.763 --> 00:00:20.697
with a specialist.

00:00:20.697 --> 00:00:22.553
Take your time.

00:00:22.553 --> 00:00:30.000
This is a demo, so it doesn't book real care.
